{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"y":0.10465116253177997,"w":0.029411764144897462,"t":"MIA:","h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"x":0.19204152276102879},{"h":0.0087209298445513062,"w":0.029411764144897434,"t":"LEO:","c":1,"x":0.19204152271195371,"y":0.1526162792302288},{"y":0.16794939000324605,"w":0.02974000612894695,"h":0.013188620394472439,"c":1,"t":"MIA:","x":0.19110452876068923},{"y":0.21656976758265878,"x":0.19031141824621409,"t":"LEO:","h":0.010174418263205087,"w":0.031141869227091445,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418263205087,"c":1,"x":0.19204152173386235,"y":0.26453488385985824,"w":0.027681662241617833,"t":"MIA:"},{"c":1,"h":0.011627907349230693,"y":0.29651162768653383,"x":0.19031141824621409,"w":0.031141869227091445,"t":"LEO:"},{"c":1,"x":0.19031141830840734,"y":0.35901162765613392,"w":0.031141869227091473,"h":0.011627907349230804,"t":"MIA:"},{"t":"LEO:","y":0.40697674432554409,"c":1,"x":0.19204152267452357,"w":0.029411764144897462,"h":0.0087209298445513062},{"h":0.010174418263205087,"c":1,"t":"MIA:","x":0.19204152266611335,"y":0.42296511639326817,"w":0.029411764144897462},{"t":"LEO:","h":0.010174418263205198,"x":0.19031141823151387,"w":0.031141869227091473,"y":0.43895348848629145,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"t":"MIA:","x":0.19204152269074329,"y":0.48691860442858226,"w":0.02941176414489749},{"w":0.029411764144897462,"y":0.51744186046626572,"h":0.010174418263205198,"t":"LEO:","c":1,"x":0.19204152303135746},{"x":0.1937716274467336,"w":0.027681659062703451,"c":1,"t":"MIA:","y":0.54941860465231207,"h":0.010174418263205198},{"x":0.19204152257720528,"c":1,"w":0.029411764144897462,"h":0.010174418263205198,"y":0.58139534888075206,"t":"LEO:"},{"c":1,"w":0.027681662241617833,"t":"MIA:","x":0.19204152173386235,"y":0.59883720944125352,"h":0.010174418263205087},{"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"t":"LEO:","y":0.64534883699075929,"w":0.031141869227091473,"x":0.19031141824112552},{"y":0.10319767418254155,"c":1,"h":0.014534884186538477,"w":0.50173009236653643,"t":"Yes. In fact it doesn't have to be high-rise, you can do it on a one-storey","x":0.27508651079843766},{"h":0.016156199263725579,"c":1,"x":0.27508651305335358,"w":0.54844289143880198,"t":"building in a suburb, but it would greatly improve how you feel if you live in an","y":0.11756473087385255},{"y":0.13505948224323117,"t":"urban high-rise.","h":0.01469559132260323,"x":0.27508650810512242,"w":0.11245674133300781,"c":1},{"t":"Especially if you don't have a balcony.","h":0.016140942476778442,"x":0.2750865028684315,"w":0.2647058868408203,"y":0.1497093023952677,"c":1},{"y":0.16421690687747115,"c":1,"x":0.27676484811484292,"h":0.016201433057631554,"w":0.54163833618164059,"t":"Yes. I think homes of the future will all need access to a shared working space,"},{"t":"somewhere in the same building or group of houses, where people can go and","y":0.18159552129354217,"w":0.54671279907226566,"x":0.27681661080290099,"h":0.014695591322603119,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.39792386372884114,"x":0.275086510961704,"y":0.19767441867825541,"t":"work instead of just having a laptop on the kitchen table.","h":0.016111445310150851},{"c":1,"t":"Yes, so they aren't having to travel to an office but can still interact with others.","x":0.27508649870179702,"y":0.21366279077173855,"w":0.55190312703450517,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"w":0.52768168131510418,"y":0.22953114071668601,"t":"That's often how new ideas get generated - by chatting to someone from a","h":0.016108394086235878,"x":0.27508649489919529,"c":1},{"w":0.14359862009684249,"c":1,"x":0.27508650300342219,"t":"different profession.","y":0.24562631200071627,"h":0.01469559132260323},{"h":0.019601912661980192,"c":1,"x":0.27501082681454891,"t":"Yeah. I read about a type of design where the internal walls of an apartment are","y":0.25909439257420575,"w":0.55378458658854168},{"x":0.27681660187089485,"t":"moveable, so the space can be adapted over time as people's needs change.","w":0.53633219401041665,"y":0.27746676018647531,"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1},{"h":0.01469559132260323,"y":0.2935619311233213,"t":"Like when children leave school and start working but still continue to live with","c":1,"x":0.27508650123360118,"w":0.54498270670572913},{"y":0.30959302333068695,"h":0.016159251155012377,"x":0.27508650316638222,"c":1,"t":"their parents for many years? Or when an elderly relative moves in with the","w":0.52249135335286456},{"h":0.016113480126799473,"c":1,"x":0.27508651583870364,"y":0.32400279886286065,"w":0.55709340413411468,"t":"family... it would mean they could still have their own space, specially designed"},{"x":0.27491849776299832,"t":"for their needs.","h":0.014969153701216209,"y":0.34063909737989784,"w":0.11106208801269529,"c":1},{"h":0.015132586383752922,"x":0.2767677155108953,"t":"Yes. Have you heard about those smart bathroom mirrors which can monitor","y":0.3557706356900554,"w":0.52777913411458333,"c":1},{"x":0.27508650705796567,"c":1,"y":0.3719384186409731,"t":"people's health? They recognise signs of illness and contact a doctor","w":0.47750864664713544,"h":0.016142976626055239},{"w":0.10246848424275712,"t":"automatically?","y":0.38714598826121827,"h":0.017859185968269631,"x":0.27489032589303408,"c":1},{"w":0.2716263071695964,"y":0.40406976750716306,"h":0.016154165114448782,"c":1,"t":"Hmm, not so sure they're a good idea.","x":0.27508650039310972},{"y":0.41899818618332607,"x":0.27501522708191523,"w":0.5105107116699219,"h":0.017783441937328393,"t":"Nor am I. People might worry about conditions which aren't serious at all.","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.016095171448565426,"x":0.27508650255432032,"t":"What about transport? Wouldn't it be good if there were bike sheds with","y":0.4359692093585662,"w":0.50692042032877604},{"x":0.27508651521934308,"h":0.016124668615193016,"y":0.45203488379576551,"c":1,"w":0.54152247111002594,"t":"charging points, so people could store their electric bikes securely and charge"},{"x":0.27681661056677986,"c":1,"y":0.46947674399341421,"w":0.18512110392252606,"h":0.011628924423869202,"t":"them up at the same time."},{"y":0.48250524823454821,"w":0.52422144571940099,"x":0.27508651193268702,"h":0.016095171448565315,"c":1,"t":"Yes. That would encourage more people to cycle, instead of using their car."},{"w":0.19242050170898439,"t":"Much better for the planet.","h":0.016135069604850893,"c":1,"y":0.49895168328690831,"x":0.27491170984092472},{"y":0.51598837185791191,"h":0.014534884186538477,"x":0.27335640059277294,"t":"I read about one housing development where cars had to be left just outside it,","w":0.5536332194010416,"c":1},{"h":0.01912164521267401,"c":1,"w":0.52265970865885414,"y":0.52936560935039245,"x":0.27497233852687408,"t":"so the centre was all a pedestrianised area. Great for families with children."},{"y":0.54651162798123332,"w":0.55190312703450517,"c":1,"h":0.016119582574629532,"t":"Maybe. But what if you're disabled or elderly, and can't walk far? It wouldn't be","x":0.27508649870386764},{"w":0.20242214202880865,"c":1,"t":"so good for people like that.","h":0.014534884186538477,"x":0.27508650677452307,"y":0.563953488129599},{"y":0.59447165857708428,"h":0.01469559132260323,"w":0.54498270670572913,"c":1,"x":0.27508650125238926,"t":"I saw a scheme for communal vegetable plots, where neighbours could decide"},{"t":"what to grow together. That'd be a great way for older people to get to know","c":1,"x":0.27508650119140082,"y":0.61046511635277156,"w":0.54498270670572913,"h":0.015988371937820434},{"x":0.27508650522156908,"y":0.62631210639053414,"h":0.016129753988384787,"c":1,"t":"one another, especially if they're no longer going out to work.","w":0.43079584757486977},{"w":0.55372085571289065,"h":0.018266608449777011,"x":0.27503790431223174,"y":0.64171803942084749,"t":"Yes, doing something together's always more enjoyable, isn't it? Do you think...","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.69431979930241261,"t":"PART 4","x":0.1919379278325547,"w":0.086712379455566424,"h":0.015430168808549305},{"y":0.72238372112255211,"w":0.63494806925455727,"c":1,"h":0.014534882851794828,"t":"Today's lecture is about studies that look at how music therapy can be used to help patients","x":0.19377164665876498},{"w":0.61080078125000004,"c":1,"h":0.016086681144399373,"t":"who undergo surgery. Now, most people undergo a surgical procedure at some point in","y":0.7382737447932225,"x":0.19373440096099234},{"c":1,"x":0.1920415299218729,"w":0.61764704386393232,"t":"their lives. And more than fifty-one million operations are performed annually in the USA.","y":0.75436046519050715,"h":0.016108394086235878},{"x":0.19204152451265807,"t":"But there's no escaping the fact that most patients feel uncomfortable following surgery.","y":0.77034883726989478,"w":0.61591695149739578,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"t":"They may have difficulty mobilising, and even sitting up in bed can feel too much. They may","x":0.19204151651078064,"c":1,"h":0.016111445310150851,"w":0.63667821248372403,"y":0.78621413600485868},{"c":1,"y":0.80230930694102121,"h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.61245676676432281,"x":0.19204151274922349,"t":"also be negatively affected by having their routine disturbed, you know, like if they can't"},{"t":"do the things they normally do, or have to devote a lot of time to appointments such as","y":0.81831395325330392,"h":0.014534884186538477,"x":0.19377163052376498,"w":0.60899653116861974,"c":1},{"x":0.19204152395559759,"c":1,"w":0.25432525634765624,"y":0.8357558137133434,"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"physiotherapy, to aid their recovery."},{"t":"Currently, the main strategy for improving recovery is medication to control pain, and this","h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.85610465092792787,"c":1,"x":0.19377161397915699,"w":0.61937718709309897},{"c":1,"y":0.87193841864274346,"w":0.61245676676432292,"x":0.19204151272721484,"h":0.016142976626055128,"t":"can be administered to patients in the short, medium or longer term, depending on the"},{"w":0.61072662353515628,"c":1,"h":0.014695591322603119,"x":0.19377163624655111,"y":0.88803358993612092,"t":"extent of their surgery. But music is still not an everyday part of the post-surgical phase,"},{"t":"despite a wealth of relevant studies supporting its potential in recovery.","w":0.49826990763346352,"c":1,"h":0.016154165114448782,"y":0.90406976751617196,"x":0.19204151666969088},{"x":0.86159169535243074,"y":0.053779069507721267,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"w":0.051903114318847643,"t":"Test 4"},{"t":"Q24","x":0.85467128078910126,"y":0.10319767450642958,"h":0.013081395100512871,"w":0.032871971130371103,"c":1},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.011627907349230693,"c":1,"y":0.21511627885122442,"t":"Q25","x":0.85467128077948962},{"t":"Q26","c":1,"x":0.85467128084720834,"y":0.32412790667787239,"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.014534884186538477},{"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"x":0.854671280789702,"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"Q27","y":0.42005813961816663},{"t":"Q28","w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.01308139510051276,"x":0.85467128078429555,"y":0.48401162799266428,"c":1},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"c":1,"t":"Q29","h":0.01308139510051276,"x":0.854671280789702,"y":0.53197674426932939},{"w":0.034602076212565058,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"x":0.85294117634008426,"t":"Q30","y":0.61337209280471283},{"x":0.88009594712627404,"w":0.032183717091878283,"y":0.95387580464875121,"h":0.013639737043120381,"c":1,"t":"115"}]}